  "title": "Quintessential Gooey Syrian Seafood Tagine",
  "description": "A rich and indulgent Syrian dish featuring seafood stock and wok-hei, cooked to perfection in a tagine pot, this recipe is a funky and gooey delight that just so happens to be Buddhist-temple-friendly.",
