  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the bottom of a tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the shrimp, mussels, and clams, and cook until the seafood starts to brown.",
    "Add the seafood stock and tagine spice blend, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, until the seafood is cooked through and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley and lemon wedges."
